WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.083 --> 00:00:32.375
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna explained

2
00:00:32.375 --> 00:00:35.000
that even after being all-pervading,

3
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.750
He isn't found by humans

4
00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.458
because humans

5
00:00:38.458 --> 00:00:40.375
are trapped in the web created by the guṇas

6
00:00:40.375 --> 00:00:42.833
of rajas, tamas, and sattva.

7
00:00:42.833 --> 00:00:44.916
But if this is so,

8
00:00:44.916 --> 00:00:48.041
then what is the way out of this web?

9
00:00:48.041 --> 00:00:50.833
This verse is the answer to this.

10
00:00:55.333 --> 00:00:57.791
In this verse, Lord Krishna is explaining

11
00:00:57.791 --> 00:00:58.708
that sattva,

12
00:00:58.708 --> 00:00:59.958
rajas, and tamas

13
00:00:59.958 --> 00:01:02.416
are parts of His divine power.

14
00:01:02.416 --> 00:01:03.833
This is that māyā

15
00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:05.958
which keeps humans enchanted.

16
00:01:05.958 --> 00:01:08.250
The power of this māyā is so strong

17
00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:11.333
that escaping from it is extremely difficult.

18
00:01:11.333 --> 00:01:14.291
But those who surrender to Krishna

19
00:01:14.291 --> 00:01:16.375
and come to His shelter

20
00:01:16.375 --> 00:01:18.000
definitely become free

21
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.250
from the influence of this māyā.

22
00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:24.208
Think – if clouds gather in the sky

23
00:01:24.208 --> 00:01:25.250
and the sun stops

24
00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:26.583
being visible,

25
00:01:26.583 --> 00:01:29.541
has the sun truly disappeared?

26
00:01:29.541 --> 00:01:30.500
No.

27
00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:31.708
We're just not able to see the sun

28
00:01:31.708 --> 00:01:35.541
because of the clouds' veil.

29
00:01:35.541 --> 00:01:38.666
Similarly, this māyā also creates

30
00:01:38.666 --> 00:01:42.958
such an illusion, such a veil before humans

31
00:01:42.958 --> 00:01:45.625
that Krishna isn't visible to us.

32
00:01:45.625 --> 00:01:47.791
Krishna is also clarifying this point

33
00:01:47.791 --> 00:01:50.875
that this māyā is one of His powers,

34
00:01:50.875 --> 00:01:54.625
and it functions under His control.

35
00:01:54.625 --> 00:01:57.708
Now this question can definitely
 arise in the mind –

36
00:01:57.708 --> 00:02:00.416
the effect of māyā is negative.

37
00:02:00.416 --> 00:02:02.041
After all, it's because of māyā

38
00:02:02.041 --> 00:02:05.041
that vices like anger, greed, and desire

39
00:02:05.041 --> 00:02:07.041
awaken in humans.

40
00:02:07.041 --> 00:02:09.958
Then how can it be Krishna's part?

41
00:02:09.958 --> 00:02:12.791
So understand this matter carefully.

42
00:02:12.791 --> 00:02:13.708
Māyā is only

43
00:02:13.708 --> 00:02:16.208
presented before humans,

44
00:02:16.208 --> 00:02:18.750
māyā's attraction is definitely strong,

45
00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:21.208
but it cannot compel anyone

46
00:02:21.208 --> 00:02:22.791
without their free will.

47
00:02:22.791 --> 00:02:23.916
For example,

48
00:02:23.916 --> 00:02:26.291
some coins are scattered on the road.

49
00:02:26.291 --> 00:02:28.250
Someone will pick them up and keep them,

50
00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:30.625
someone will search for their rightful owner.

51
00:02:30.625 --> 00:02:32.333
The coins were only presented,

52
00:02:32.333 --> 00:02:34.750
being negatively influenced by them

53
00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.500
was human's decision.

54
00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:39.416
Māyā is also only presented in the same way.

55
00:02:39.416 --> 00:02:42.000
Being negatively influenced by it

56
00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:43.750
or remaining untouched

57
00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:46.708
is based on human's power of wisdom.

58
00:02:46.708 --> 00:02:49.708
Krishna Himself calls this māyā duratyayā,

59
00:02:49.708 --> 00:02:52.333
meaning it's extremely difficult

60
00:02:52.333 --> 00:02:53.916
to conquer it with one's own strength.

61
00:02:53.916 --> 00:02:55.166
Understand it like this –

62
00:02:55.166 --> 00:02:58.416
māyā is like a difficult exam

63
00:02:58.416 --> 00:03:01.291
which isn't easy to pass.

64
00:03:01.291 --> 00:03:03.000
To pass it,

65
00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:04.958
a guru will be needed,

66
00:03:04.958 --> 00:03:07.541
and then only one who passes once

67
00:03:07.541 --> 00:03:10.666
will be able to reach close to Krishna.

68
00:03:10.666 --> 00:03:11.958
In this verse, Krishna is also

69
00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:15.041
suggesting that remedy by using which

70
00:03:15.041 --> 00:03:16.250
gurus passed

71
00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:18.750
this difficult exam of māyā.

72
00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:20.166
And that remedy is

73
00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:21.375
surrender.

74
00:03:21.375 --> 00:03:22.375
One who has

75
00:03:22.375 --> 00:03:24.291
completely surrendered to Krishna,

76
00:03:24.291 --> 00:03:27.791
will pass this exam of māyā.

77
00:03:27.791 --> 00:03:29.916
Māyā is under Krishna's control,

78
00:03:29.916 --> 00:03:32.666
so one who has directly surrendered to Krishna,

79
00:03:32.666 --> 00:03:35.875
what's there to fear from His māyā power?

80
00:03:35.875 --> 00:03:36.875
The essence of this verse

81
00:03:36.875 --> 00:03:39.000
is this – that one who has

82
00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:40.333
crossed this difficult exam of māyā

83
00:03:40.333 --> 00:03:43.416
by surrendering to Krishna

84
00:03:43.416 --> 00:03:46.541
will definitely attain liberation.

85
00:03:50.833 --> 00:03:52.375
Don't underestimate

86
00:03:52.375 --> 00:03:56.125
the temptations of this world.

87
00:03:56.125 --> 00:03:58.250
This illusory power

88
00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:02.041
is extremely influential.

89
00:04:02.041 --> 00:04:06.625
It blurs your spiritual vision,

90
00:04:06.625 --> 00:04:08.750
traps you in the cycle of desire,

91
00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:12.500
greed, and craving.

92
00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:17.875
Wealth, high position, material
 pleasure, bodily joy –

93
00:04:17.875 --> 00:04:21.666
all these appear so attractive

94
00:04:21.666 --> 00:04:22.500
that humans

95
00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:27.500
consider them their final goal.

96
00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:29.125
And then

97
00:04:29.125 --> 00:04:33.625
wander in darkness.

98
00:04:33.625 --> 00:04:36.666
Then what should be done?

99
00:04:36.666 --> 00:04:38.666
Understand it like this –

100
00:04:38.666 --> 00:04:43.291
you're in an airplane among clouds,

101
00:04:43.291 --> 00:04:45.791
nothing is visible.

102
00:04:45.791 --> 00:04:47.666
The pilot of that plane

103
00:04:47.666 --> 00:04:51.750
also can't see anything,

104
00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:54.000
but still

105
00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:57.083
doesn't stray from the path,

106
00:04:57.083 --> 00:05:00.833
safely delivers the plane and you

107
00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:05.250
to your destination.

108
00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:07.708
How?

109
00:05:07.708 --> 00:05:09.666
Because that plane

110
00:05:09.666 --> 00:05:13.416
maintains constant contact with
 the control center on earth

111
00:05:13.416 --> 00:05:20.125
through sound waves.

112
00:05:20.125 --> 00:05:21.833
And this very thing

113
00:05:21.833 --> 00:05:24.958
keeps it on the right path,

114
00:05:24.958 --> 00:05:28.958
doesn't let it stray.

115
00:05:28.958 --> 00:05:32.500
Similarly, understand

116
00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:37.583
that if you remain in constant
 contact with the Gita,

117
00:05:37.583 --> 00:05:40.250
then the waves of its knowledge

118
00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:43.958
will take you out from these clouds of māyā

119
00:05:43.958 --> 00:05:48.250
and safely deliver you to your destination.

120
00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:50.875
When you remain connected

121
00:05:50.875 --> 00:05:53.291
to this divine knowledge of the Gita,

122
00:05:53.291 --> 00:05:57.250
then everything starts appearing clear.

123
00:05:57.250 --> 00:06:01.166
The clouds of material temptations clear,

124
00:06:01.166 --> 00:06:07.375
your spiritual form starts becoming clear, and

125
00:06:07.375 --> 00:06:08.750
you're

126
00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:12.416
able to reach Me.

127
00:06:12.416 --> 00:06:16.041
Rise above these attractions of māyā,

128
00:06:16.041 --> 00:06:18.750
know your truth.

129
00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:20.625
Come to Me.

130
00:06:20.625 --> 00:06:26.500
I am always ready to guide you.

131
00:06:30.875 --> 00:06:36.083
The grip of māyā is extremely powerful.

132
00:06:36.083 --> 00:06:40.541
And its web is so tangled

133
00:06:40.541 --> 00:06:42.833
that a person trapped in it

134
00:06:42.833 --> 00:06:48.916
gets more entangled instead of escaping.

135
00:06:48.916 --> 00:06:54.041
You must have also seen in
 the family that someone

136
00:06:54.041 --> 00:06:58.250
 is such who is struggling
 with their bad habits –

137
00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:02.083
someone with the habit of intoxication,
 someone with the habit of anger,

138
00:07:02.083 --> 00:07:05.791
someone with desire.

139
00:07:05.791 --> 00:07:07.916
That person's well-wishers

140
00:07:07.916 --> 00:07:10.833
and family members

141
00:07:10.833 --> 00:07:14.583
are giving them love, counsel, support,

142
00:07:14.583 --> 00:07:16.041
but

143
00:07:16.041 --> 00:07:19.041
still no change is coming.

144
00:07:19.041 --> 00:07:21.458
That person says that

145
00:07:21.458 --> 00:07:24.541
they'll leave all these,

146
00:07:24.541 --> 00:07:27.541
but then gets attracted to those very vices,

147
00:07:27.541 --> 00:07:32.875
those very habits again.

148
00:07:32.875 --> 00:07:37.041
This is māyā's powerful influence.

149
00:07:37.041 --> 00:07:39.708
Māyā is such a power

150
00:07:39.708 --> 00:07:44.541
that binds a person in its web.

151
00:07:44.541 --> 00:07:46.291
Ordinarily,

152
00:07:46.291 --> 00:07:49.166
humans don't even understand

153
00:07:49.166 --> 00:07:53.041
that they're trapped in bondage,

154
00:07:53.041 --> 00:07:55.541
rather sometimes

155
00:07:55.541 --> 00:07:57.833
that person considers remaining

156
00:07:57.833 --> 00:08:00.875
trapped in this web as truth.

157
00:08:00.875 --> 00:08:04.916
Inspires others too.

158
00:08:04.916 --> 00:08:08.541
You must have also seen this that those who

159
00:08:08.541 --> 00:08:12.291
consume alcohol and meat, they constantly

160
00:08:12.291 --> 00:08:14.750
instigate those around them

161
00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:19.708
to also consume these.

162
00:08:19.708 --> 00:08:22.375
Then what should be done?

163
00:08:22.375 --> 00:08:25.333
Now there are two dilemmas in this.

164
00:08:25.333 --> 00:08:28.208
One is that you yourself are worried for

165
00:08:28.208 --> 00:08:31.000
the welfare of that family member,

166
00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:34.125
sad, so first of all

167
00:08:34.125 --> 00:08:37.500
you come to My shelter.

168
00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:42.291
Take continuous guidance from this Gita.

169
00:08:42.291 --> 00:08:44.500
You'll experience peace.

170
00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:48.958
Negativity toward that person
 will also reduce in you,

171
00:08:48.958 --> 00:08:50.958
because you'll know

172
00:08:50.958 --> 00:08:53.958
that poor one is helpless.

173
00:08:53.958 --> 00:08:58.541
And yes, when you experience peace,

174
00:08:58.541 --> 00:09:03.458
then the right way to help
 will also become visible.

175
00:09:03.458 --> 00:09:07.166
And that way is to talk to that person.

176
00:09:07.166 --> 00:09:11.875
To inspire them too toward
 the Gita and spirituality.

177
00:09:11.875 --> 00:09:15.250
Not by being angry at them, but

178
00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:18.500
peacefully showing them this truth

179
00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:22.583
that they're harming themselves.

180
00:09:22.583 --> 00:09:26.750
And ultimately that path is

181
00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:28.875
of patience.

182
00:09:28.875 --> 00:09:31.125
You maintain patience,

183
00:09:31.125 --> 00:09:33.750
everything will be fine.

184
00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:37.708
The bondage of māyā is definitely powerful,

185
00:09:37.708 --> 00:09:40.916
but can be broken.

186
00:09:40.916 --> 00:09:44.708
Just faith must be maintained.

187
00:09:44.708 --> 00:09:48.416
One must remain surrendered to Me.

188
00:09:52.875 --> 00:09:57.625
In professional life, continuing
 to walk on the right path

189
00:09:57.625 --> 00:10:00.375
is extremely necessary for success.

190
00:10:00.375 --> 00:10:03.916
And everyone remains in this very effort.

191
00:10:03.916 --> 00:10:05.208
But what if

192
00:10:05.208 --> 00:10:09.000
the map in your hand,

193
00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:11.541
that is wrong?

194
00:10:11.541 --> 00:10:16.791
Then without knowing, you'll take a wrong turn.

195
00:10:16.791 --> 00:10:20.666
And the biggest irony is

196
00:10:20.666 --> 00:10:23.958
that even after taking a wrong turn,

197
00:10:23.958 --> 00:10:26.458
you'll keep feeling

198
00:10:26.458 --> 00:10:30.500
that you're on the right path. And this mistake

199
00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:34.500
will be revealed much later.

200
00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:37.500
Then nothing will remain

201
00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:40.375
except regret.

202
00:10:40.375 --> 00:10:43.833
This is māyā's influence –

203
00:10:43.833 --> 00:10:46.250
that even while being on the wrong path,

204
00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:50.875
you many times cannot recognize it.

205
00:10:50.875 --> 00:10:52.375
In professional life,

206
00:10:52.375 --> 00:10:56.208
many examples of this will be found.

207
00:10:56.208 --> 00:10:57.833
For example,

208
00:10:57.833 --> 00:11:01.916
some colleague gave such a suggestion

209
00:11:01.916 --> 00:11:06.083
that is completely opposite to your thinking.

210
00:11:06.083 --> 00:11:10.291
Even if that suggestion is right, but

211
00:11:10.291 --> 00:11:14.500
because now ego is hurt,

212
00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:16.375
then without knowing,

213
00:11:16.375 --> 00:11:21.583
you'll hold tightly to even your wrong decision.

214
00:11:21.583 --> 00:11:24.833
Because now what is right,

215
00:11:24.833 --> 00:11:27.291
this is not important.

216
00:11:27.291 --> 00:11:30.500
Whose words will be accepted,

217
00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:35.291
this has become more important.

218
00:11:35.291 --> 00:11:36.708
This is

219
00:11:36.708 --> 00:11:41.500
a small example of ego's māyā.

220
00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:44.500
Many times it also happens
 that for the organization's

221
00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:48.916
success some other decision is right, but

222
00:11:48.916 --> 00:11:51.916
you, due to your personal greed,

223
00:11:51.916 --> 00:11:54.666
take some different decision.

224
00:11:54.666 --> 00:11:56.125
Organization's condition,

225
00:11:56.125 --> 00:11:58.916
don't think of your colleagues.

226
00:11:58.916 --> 00:12:03.208
This is māyā of greed.

227
00:12:03.208 --> 00:12:06.000
Then what can be done?

228
00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:07.958
First of all,

229
00:12:07.958 --> 00:12:09.875
know this.

230
00:12:09.875 --> 00:12:13.375
Humility is extremely necessary.

231
00:12:13.375 --> 00:12:15.000
One who is humble

232
00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:17.666
doesn't have this ego

233
00:12:17.666 --> 00:12:20.666
that only their path is right.

234
00:12:20.666 --> 00:12:25.041
One who is humble thinks not only of their greed,

235
00:12:25.041 --> 00:12:27.291
but also of others.

236
00:12:27.291 --> 00:12:29.708
And along with humility, what's necessary is

237
00:12:29.708 --> 00:12:35.708
to slowly escape from this web of māyā,

238
00:12:35.708 --> 00:12:39.958
for which spiritual upliftment

239
00:12:39.958 --> 00:12:43.083
is extremely important.

240
00:12:43.083 --> 00:12:47.750
And for spiritual upliftment,

241
00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:51.916
this knowledge of the Gita will be helpful.

242
00:12:51.916 --> 00:12:56.041
When your mind and intellect are inspired

243
00:12:56.041 --> 00:12:58.250
by this Gita's higher knowledge,

244
00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:00.958
then your perspective will improve.

245
00:13:00.958 --> 00:13:06.500
You won't remain bound in personal
 greed and ego, rather

246
00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:10.333
you'll start getting inspired toward higher

247
00:13:10.333 --> 00:13:12.500
purposes of society and organization

248
00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:15.208
and this will bring improvement in you.

249
00:13:15.208 --> 00:13:19.875
Your decisions and steps will automatically
 start being taken

250
00:13:19.875 --> 00:13:24.250
in the right direction. And also, just as

251
00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:27.041
the North Star remains stable,

252
00:13:27.041 --> 00:13:31.625
doesn't let travelers ever stray,

253
00:13:31.625 --> 00:13:34.000
similarly

254
00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:35.833
focus your attention

255
00:13:35.833 --> 00:13:38.541
on Me.

256
00:13:38.541 --> 00:13:41.250
I am this universe's

257
00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:43.291
focal point.

258
00:13:43.291 --> 00:13:45.750
That North Star

259
00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:50.208
which will never let you stray.
